```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Joke Website</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            background-color: #f0f8ff;
        }
        .container {
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #e0f7fa;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        h1, h2 {
            color: #1a237e;
        }
        button {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #ffffff;
            background-color: #1a237e;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        button:hover {
            background-color: #1e3a8a;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <h1>My Joke Website</h1>
    <h2>[Funny Joke]</h2>
    <button onclick="revealJoke()">[push to reveal punchline]</button>
</div>

<script>
    function revealJoke() {
        document.querySelector("h2").innerText = "Why don't scientists trust atoms? Because they make up everything!";
    }
</script>

</body>
</html>
```
